---
import ContentPage from "../layouts/ContentPage.astro";
import { APP_URL } from "../lib/config";

const site = "https://refocus.co.in";
const title = "About Refocus";
const description =
  "Refocus is a virtual co-working room for deep work — pick a session, get paired with someone who's also there to focus, and get the thing done.";

const jsonLd = [
  {
    "@context": "https://schema.org",
    "@type": "AboutPage",
    name: "About Refocus",
    url: `${site}/about`,
    description,
  },
  {
    "@context": "https://schema.org",
    "@type": "Organization",
    name: "Refocus",
    url: site,
    logo: `${site}/icon1.png`,
    email: "hello@refocus.co.in",
  },
];
---

<ContentPage
  title={title}
  description={description}
  canonical="/about"
  heading="About Refocus"
  jsonLd={jsonLd}
>
  <p>
    Refocus is a virtual co-working room built around accountability, not
    conversation. You pick a session length, get paired with someone else who's
    also there to focus, briefly share what you're working on, then work side by
    side with synced timers — with a short check-in at the end.
  </p>

  <h2>Why we built it</h2>
  <p>
    A lot of us are productive in libraries and coffee shops but fall apart
    alone at home. The thing that reliably helps isn't another app or a longer
    to-do list — it's another person in the room, quietly working. That's called
    <strong>body doubling</strong>, and it's the idea Refocus is built on. Your
    friends aren't always free when you need to focus, and most video tools feel
    like meetings. Refocus is the opposite: quiet, low-pressure company for deep
    work.
  </p>

  <h2>Who it's for</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>Students preparing for competitive exams and long study cycles</li>
    <li>Remote workers and freelancers who miss the energy of an office</li>
    <li>People with ADHD who find it easier to start with someone present</li>
    <li>Anyone who knows what to do but struggles to start and stay on task</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>How a session works</h2>
  <ol>
    <li>Pick a 25, 50, or 75 minute session.</li>
    <li>Get matched with someone who's also there to focus.</li>
    <li>Say what you'll work on.</li>
    <li>Work side by side with a shared timer.</li>
    <li>Check in at the end — what you got done, how it went.</li>
  </ol>

  <h2>Get in touch</h2>
  <p>
    Questions, feedback, or ideas? Email
    <a href="mailto:hello@refocus.co.in">hello@refocus.co.in</a>. You can also
    read the <a href="/blog">blog</a> or
    <a href={`${APP_URL}/auth/sign-up`}>try a session</a>.
  </p>
</ContentPage>
